{"body":"This is the standalone docs refresh for `docs/config-architecture.md`. The MC/musica YAML-pipeline design is unchanged; the substantive addition is a dated `Update (2026-06-15)` block recording where the code has moved since the doc was written:

- the `convention` the MVP reads is an **on-mesh** layout (MPAS-mesh-flat, already remapped) currently mislabelled `"eccad"` — the real files are `bc_anth_<sector>` / `xtime`, not ECCAD lat/lon;
- ECCAD-proper enforcement belongs to the later remapping phase, not the MVP;
- `Regridding` stays a v1 `None`-only guard.

I kept it to the governing Update block rather than surgically renaming `convention: eccad` throughout, because the code still literally uses `"eccad"` — the actual rename is reader work.

